        "orario": "15:12",
        "timestamp": 1773583956,
        "contenuto_esteso": "United Nations Ambassador Mike Waltz on Sunday said that the U.S. is demanding that international allies help escort ships through the Strait of Hormuz amid the conflict in Iran. \"President Trump is calling upon the world, saying the entire world is affected,\" Waltz told CNN's Jake Tapper on \"State of the Union.\" \"Iran can't hold..."
